WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:34.530
A boy!

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:37.010
Tell me it's a boy this time!

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:41.640
I-It can't be!

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:46.480
No, as you can see she's a beautiful princess.

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:54.090
In a family of generals who command
the military and protect the royal family,

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:55.410
there is no need for a girl!

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:02.830
Wh-What are you doing?

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:09.040
I've decided! You are a boy!

00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:13.970
Your name is Oscar! My son!

