00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:56.030
episode

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:56.030
"Oscar!
\h    The Destiny of the Rose"

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:00.710
<i>The year is 1769.</i>

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:04.770
<i>14 years have passed since Oscar was born.</i>

00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:08.190
<i>Here, at the Palace of Versailles,</i>

00:03:08.190 --> 00:03:11.230
<i>another magnificent ball
was taking place as usual,</i>

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:14.290
<i>despite the poverty of its people.</i>

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:20.190
<i>All were blissfully unaware that in 20 years time,
the French Revolution would take place.</i>

00:03:26.740 --> 00:03:29.690
How unusual! It's General Jarjayes!

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:31.940
My, it is!

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.450
Say, General Jarjayes.

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:37.480
Have you finally brought
Oscar with you tonight?

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:40.720
Oscar is rumored to be very beautiful.

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:44.370
I was very much looking
forward to seeing her tonight.

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.790
Well, that's...

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:48.260
Come on! Done already?

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:49.060
Damn it!

00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:54.400
Oscar! Shouldn't you go to Versailles?

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:55.460
Why you...!

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:57.200
Why should I go to a place like that?

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:14.480
You've lost your touch, André.

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:17.820
Damn it!

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:27.500
Lady Oscar! André, you too!

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:30.250
How long do you plan on swinging
those dangerous things around?

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:32.500
Yikes, it's my grandma, Oscar.

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:33.370
Hey!

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:35.800
It's Lady Oscar! Say Lady Oscar!

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:38.000
It's all right, Nanna.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:40.050
No! A title is a title!

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:42.550
André, you're a servant...

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:43.470
Look out!

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:52.020
In a proper world, at her age, she should
be making her society debut in this dress.

00:04:52.590 --> 00:04:54.960
No, I refuse to give up!

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:58.730
I swear I'll make Lady Oscar wear this dress!

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:03.700
Your Majesty, General Jarjayes is here.

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:06.440
It's been a while, Jarjayes.

00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:07.660
Come here.

00:05:08.110 --> 00:05:08.770
Yes.

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:14.620
Concerning your long-standing request about
the post of Commander of the Royal Guards...

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:19.720
I believe you are aware that Count
Girodelle's son is also a candidate?

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:21.990
I hear he is a magnificent swordsman.

00:05:21.990 --> 00:05:27.160
Yes. However, my son, Oscar is second to
none when it comes to swordsmanship.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:29.010
''My son,'' you say?

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:32.570
M-My apologies! Actually...

00:05:32.570 --> 00:05:34.020
It's all right.

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:37.670
I've heard the rumors about the great
lengths you went to, in order to raise her,

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:39.570
as you weren't blessed with a son.

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:45.070
What do you say? How about a match with
Girodelle and whoever wins gets the post?

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:45.940
Yes!

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:49.740
In truth, I hope to see Oscar
take the post of Commander.

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:55.710
I want a procession as splendid and elegant
as possible to guard Marie Antoinette.

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:00.850
<i>In the 18th century,</i>

00:06:01.430 --> 00:06:04.260
<i>Europe was engaged in endless warfare.</i>

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:12.360
<i>Among them, France and Austria, with their
enormous military might, fought constantly.</i>

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:18.110
<i>However, realizing such conflicts
only benefit other countries,</i>

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:24.320
<i>Empress Maria Theresa of Austria proposed
a peace treaty between the two countries.</i>

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:27.720
<i>Subsequently, a historic alliance was formed.</i>

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:36.360
<i>To seal their alliance, the engagement of
Marie Antoinette, Theresa's youngest daughter,</i>

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:39.460
<i>and the Dauphin of France was arranged.</i>

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:45.920
What do you think, Oscar?

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:51.380
Even for the renowned French Royal Guards,
no duty will be as important as this one.

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:54.280
Your duty is to protect Lady Marie.

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:57.560
But first, you must defeat Girodelle,

00:06:57.560 --> 00:07:01.090
which is the least of my concerns.

00:07:01.090 --> 00:07:05.530
After all, I have taught you swordsmanship
for 14 years, and prepared you for this.

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:07.990
Here, try it on.

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:13.080
What's the matter?

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:16.960
I do not wish to babysit a girl.

00:07:19.610 --> 00:07:21.970
Everyone, give me a hand.

00:07:22.410 --> 00:07:23.640
How beautiful!

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:25.110
There are so many!

00:07:25.110 --> 00:07:27.980
We're going to beautifully decorate
Lady Oscar's room with these.

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:29.120
Grandma.

00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:30.510
Do you know where Oscar is?

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:33.620
Say Lady Oscar, André!

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:36.680
You're just the son of a servant!

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:37.720
You fool!

00:07:38.530 --> 00:07:39.920
Cool your head!

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:53.780
If you'll excuse me.

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:54.680
Oscar!

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:56.240
The match is at noon tomorrow!

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:59.710
Remember that His Majesty will be there!

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:04.420
Lady Oscar...!

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:22.340
Such a spectacular sight at today's event.

00:08:22.340 --> 00:08:24.470
All the ladies of the court are in attendance.

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:26.540
This hasn't happened since
the parade grounds opened.

00:08:26.540 --> 00:08:28.610
We'll finally be able to get to see Oscar today.

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:30.740
Oh, I can hardly wait!

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:31.840
Attention!

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:37.680
Count Jarjayes.

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:40.020
It's His Majesty.

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:46.260
Count Jarjayes. There's less than
30 minutes until the match.

00:08:46.260 --> 00:08:48.600
I pray your son is coming.

00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:50.130
I believe he is.

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:51.880
No, I am certain he is coming!

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:57.540
<i>I never imagined this would
turn into such a spectacle...!</i>

00:08:57.540 --> 00:09:00.810
<i>Oscar, hurry...! Hurry up!</i>

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:09.050
It's almost time, Master Girodelle.

00:09:09.050 --> 00:09:11.490
Don't be so anxious.
We're only a short distance away.

00:09:11.490 --> 00:09:13.620
You seem rather reluctant.

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:14.750
Of course, I am.

00:09:15.390 --> 00:09:17.450
What glory is there in defeating a woman?

00:09:19.230 --> 00:09:22.560
It's regrettable that I must obtain the
post of Commander in such a fashion.

00:09:34.570 --> 00:09:36.870
I've been waiting for you, Captain Girodelle.

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:39.970
I am Oscar François de Jarjayes.

00:09:40.610 --> 00:09:41.510
Oh...!

00:09:42.050 --> 00:09:45.020
I've heard the rumors, but you
are as beautiful as they say.

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:46.950
Let us hurry then.

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:50.820
The palace snobs are eagerly
waiting to get a glimpse of you.

00:09:52.430 --> 00:09:53.550
Captain Girodelle.

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:58.630
I do not wish to become the
Commander of the Royal Guards.

00:09:58.630 --> 00:10:01.070
Oh, is that so?

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:02.430
That's very wise of you.

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:07.010
Then, I will inform them that
you have withdrawn your bid.

00:10:07.010 --> 00:10:10.420
However, I'm not running away
because I'm afraid of you.

00:10:12.450 --> 00:10:15.880
I'd like to prove that to you at least.

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:19.750
So you would like to have our match here?

00:10:21.920 --> 00:10:22.860
Did you hear that?

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:26.560
I would advise against that,
Mademoiselle Oscar.

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:29.660
If you haven't figured it out,
let me explain further.

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:32.650
I do not wish to shame you
in front of a large crowd.

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:38.780
Or are you afraid of losing to a woman?

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:47.410
If you wish it, I am willing
to accept your challenge.

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:51.510
But how could I possibly point
a sword at your beautiful face—

00:10:53.150 --> 00:10:55.420
Wh-What are you doing to my Master?!

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:56.680
Please accept.

00:10:56.680 --> 00:11:00.530
I may be a woman, but I am still a warrior.
This is the only way to protect my honor!

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:02.360
I see.

00:11:02.360 --> 00:11:03.450
I accept your challenge.

00:11:26.020 --> 00:11:27.750
As a woman, you're certainly agile.

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:42.640
Thank you.

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:44.510
I'm satisfied now.

00:11:44.940 --> 00:11:46.970
W-Wait!

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:48.800
The match has only begun!

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:09.620
Where are Oscar and Girodelle?

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:11.300
Count Jarjayes!

00:12:11.300 --> 00:12:13.300
Where is your son?!

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:15.590
Y-Yes, my apologies...

00:12:18.370 --> 00:12:19.040
Oh!

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:20.200
Th-They're here!

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:25.280
It's an emergency! It's a duel!

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:28.680
Lady Oscar was waiting for my
Master and challenged him!

00:12:30.420 --> 00:12:32.940
What?! Oscar...!

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:48.130
Why must you be so defiant?!

00:12:48.130 --> 00:12:50.410
Can you not understand your father's concerns?!

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:55.180
Listen, whatever His Majesty
decides at Versailles today,

00:12:55.180 --> 00:12:57.980
a traitor like you can make no excuses!

00:12:57.980 --> 00:12:59.130
Be prepared!

00:13:04.180 --> 00:13:07.210
It's all so frustrating...

00:13:11.090 --> 00:13:14.360
Who would have thought the
master was that serious...

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:15.400
Hold it.

00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:17.600
That's enough, Grandma!

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:19.730
How many glasses have you had already?

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:20.500
What's wrong with having...

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:23.670
...a few drinks once in a while?
I can't help but drink tonight!

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:27.010
If I were Lady Oscar,
I would have done the same!

00:13:27.010 --> 00:13:30.080
I'd never wear a military uniform!

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:31.850
It's no laughing matter.

00:13:31.850 --> 00:13:35.250
Oscar is charged with treason and none
of us knows what's going to happen.

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:37.620
Grandma!

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:39.090
What did I tell you...?

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:40.380
Get a hold of yourself!

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:41.600
Lady Oscar...

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:45.050
This is a battle between man and woman...

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:56.740
<i>A battle between man and woman...</i>

00:13:56.740 --> 00:13:57.830
<i>I see.</i>

00:13:57.830 --> 00:13:59.730
<i>Probably in Oscar's heart...</i>

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:07.570
ls that you, André? Come in.

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:13.750
We're finally moving on to the part about
the Hundred Years' War today, right?

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:14.980
Yes, that's right.

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:22.620
A spring storm...

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:30.600
Leave it open.

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:35.880
Things seem fine when
you're focused on running.

00:14:35.880 --> 00:14:42.450
But when you suddenly stop and look down at
your feet, you wonder where you're headed to...

00:14:42.450 --> 00:14:44.440
Has that ever happened to you?

00:14:45.620 --> 00:14:49.910
You're wondering why I won't wear
the military uniform, aren't you?

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:52.660
Damn it!

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:54.910
I hate it! Why should I have to babysit a girl?!

00:14:55.900 --> 00:14:57.600
ls that really the only reason?

00:14:57.600 --> 00:14:59.370
Perhaps what you really mean is...

00:15:08.210 --> 00:15:09.280
Go.

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:10.400
Please go!

00:15:13.650 --> 00:15:15.430
<i>Good night, Oscar...</i>

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:43.360
Master...!

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:47.750
Something truly unbelievable has happened.

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:50.050
His Majesty's anger was great,

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:53.300
but Captain Girodelle, who was wounded
by Oscar, came forward...

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:56.810
...and said that only Oscar is worthy of the post
of Commander of the Royal Guards.

00:15:57.590 --> 00:16:01.860
His Majesty was so moved
he forgave Oscar's actions.

00:16:01.860 --> 00:16:06.500
And then, he appointed Oscar as the
Commander of the Royal Guards!

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:08.470
She can no longer run from this!

00:16:08.470 --> 00:16:10.700
It's His Majesty's order!

00:16:11.040 --> 00:16:14.470
André, there's a chance she'll listen to you!

00:16:14.470 --> 00:16:18.160
Convince Oscar to wear that
military uniform, no matter what!

00:16:43.340 --> 00:16:44.600
Hi, good morning.

00:16:45.410 --> 00:16:47.070
Hi, you're up early.

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:50.070
It's been a while, so why don't we go riding?

00:17:25.380 --> 00:17:28.720
Do you remember that time
when we almost drowned here?

00:17:28.720 --> 00:17:29.580
Yeah.

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:31.180
How could I ever forget?

00:17:31.180 --> 00:17:34.190
You were 6 and I was 5.

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:35.360
Yeah.

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:38.190
We both swam for our lives.

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:50.970
Stop.

00:17:50.970 --> 00:17:52.670
Stop blowing that grass whistle
and cut to the chase!

00:17:55.640 --> 00:17:56.630
What's the matter?

00:17:57.440 --> 00:17:59.350
Isn't there something you have to say to me?

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:00.810
Not really.

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:03.640
Just say it already!
Tell me to wear the military uniform!

00:18:07.220 --> 00:18:09.620
If you don't want to wear it, then don't.

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:12.110
ls that your trick?!

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:15.600
If you say not to wear it, rebellious
Oscar will surely do the opposite!

00:18:15.600 --> 00:18:16.580
Is that what you're thinking?!

00:18:18.900 --> 00:18:19.760
Why you...!

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:45.790
Damn it!

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:14.190
<i>That's it!</i>

00:19:14.190 --> 00:19:15.690
<i>It's those spirited eyes, Oscar!</i>

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:16.820
<i>Punch me!</i>

00:19:16.820 --> 00:19:17.880
<i>Punch me as hard as you can!</i>

00:19:54.890 --> 00:19:57.130
This is the first time we fought like this...

00:19:57.800 --> 00:20:02.550
I heard you talking to my father last night.

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:05.670
Oscar...

00:20:05.670 --> 00:20:07.800
Now, say it, André.

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:10.910
I understand where your father is coming from.

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:16.740
But I didn't want your life to
be held down because of it.

00:20:16.740 --> 00:20:17.680
That's why...

00:20:17.680 --> 00:20:20.190
That's why I chose not to say anything.

00:20:36.340 --> 00:20:38.600
Oscar! Let me just say this,

00:20:38.600 --> 00:20:40.720
and I swear I won't say it ever again.

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:45.440
Oscar!

00:20:46.350 --> 00:20:48.250
It's not too late!

00:20:48.250 --> 00:20:53.320
If you want to become a woman
again, now is the time!

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:08.100
Well?

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:09.620
Did you manage to persuade her?

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:15.090
Y-You don't mean... André!

00:21:15.680 --> 00:21:19.050
Oscar has a right to choose her own path.

00:21:25.080 --> 00:21:26.340
Master!

00:21:51.880 --> 00:21:57.010
<i>Father, this is not for you, nor for anyone else.</i>

00:22:04.690 --> 00:22:05.850
Let us go, André.

00:22:06.430 --> 00:22:07.150
Yeah.

00:22:08.590 --> 00:22:11.530
<i>That day, Oscar left her womanhood behind,</i>

00:22:12.230 --> 00:22:15.930
<i>and took her first step into
a new world of adulthood.</i>

00:22:16.700 --> 00:22:22.710
<i>Oscar, unaware that a tumultuous destiny of
love and death awaits her in the distant future,</i>

00:22:22.710 --> 00:22:25.070
<i>was 14 years old that spring.</i>

00:22:27.700 --> 00:22:31.910
